    },
    "description": {
      "value": "Shining, slippery eelskin covers the plates of this +1 resilient greater slick leather armor. The armor gives you the ability to breathe water and grants you a +2 item bonus to Athletics checks to Swim and Stealth checks you attempt in the water.\n\nActivate (2 Actions); Frequency once per hour\nYou cast a 2nd-level shocking grasp with a spell attack modifier of +19."
